2026-11-06T02:56:57.2346270Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2346864Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2347233Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2347550Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2348140Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2348568Z    /root
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2361855Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2362519Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2372981Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2373725Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T02:56:57.2374061Z 
